# env.optional — precision supplement only; the free serp-derived report is complete without these.
#
# Measured traffic/authority/backlinks/ranked-keywords via scripts/paid_seo.py (DataForSEO,
# HTTP Basic auth). When set, the estimate labels upgrade to "measured"; absent -> the free
# serp-derived report (the adapter exits gracefully, keyless flow continues):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
# Semrush/Ahrefs-scraper actor for more precise traffic/backlink numbers:
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Bring-your-own paid SEO API (NO Robomotion package, alternative to DataForSEO; not wired
# into paid_seo.py — call via curl):
SEMRUSH_API_KEY
AHREFS_API_KEY
# Bring-your-own-key synthesis instead of platform-default model (usually unset):
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
OPENAI_API_KEY
